+The core cross-bilateral filter operation for a function $h$ is defined as [S1]:
 $$
 \tilde{h}(x) = \frac{1}{z(x)} \int_{\Omega} h(y) w_s(x,y) w_d(\theta(y),\theta(x)) dy
